   "confidence": "low",
   "notes": "Christ's Lane (2006) block, St Andrew's Street front between the Metro Bank corner (p0 end) and the projecting glazed-box block to the SSE. Buff sandstone cladding; ground floor recessed shop glazing behind a colonnade of round stone columns; one tall upper level with a run of narrow full-height windows framed by stone fins; plain parapet band above. Window count (6) read obliquely from mapillary 941221033333012 / 4232489523430115; tenants change, so no fascia text."
